Bill Dunlap of Insightful solved my problem (original posting below).

S-PLUS wasn't recognizing the object names because somewhere along the way
the names had gotten changed from lower case to upper case.  Once I renamed
the files to their original lower case names (in Windows Explorer) they
were immediately accessible.

Thanks, Bill!  You just spared me from some major headaches.

