A few days ago I complained about not being able to include Splus
encapsulated postscript files in ps documents generated with GNU
enscript.  A fix that works for me is to change the enscript prologue
slightly as follows:

Edit the definition of the function `EndEPSF' in file
"/usr/local/share/enscript/enscript.pro" so that the line
  count op_count sub { pos } repeat      % Clean up stacks
                       ^^^
becomes
  count op_count sub { pop } repeat      % Clean up stacks
                       ^^^
I believe this is a bug and have reported it to the GNU enscript
maintainer.

